msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As was characteristic of the area, cloudy days and rain were frequent during this season, "
"but the sun almost always took the stage the day after a storm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫В течение всего сезона дожди были частым явлением в этом краю, но солнце почти всегда "
"выходило на смену буре."

#: scenario:scenario_B1972126_9191_470D_8CD6_E8E1A37076AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0620db414952aaf98850b9973b53508d3141ac19555fad6d08ddfd82f69ea932
