#: scenario:scenario_3889ECE8_14D0_4B02_A043_8975F3066FAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8821d730d185007c8bb598ad5b90069cddb87a789fe9493a8bde0936aad4553b
