msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7BF2CCDF_724E_4FC0_A216_50B4B754228A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And she had not summoned only her personal servants, but others as well—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫including "
"the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Работали при этом не только ее служанки, но и некоторые другие—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫в том числе и "
"Белокурая Девушка."

#: scenario:scenario_2649E325_FADA_41C0_BA9D_34CD2CFE9BD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f564a0b81ff2b9813f0ceb40f1a985633a9602891757447aad63cb4f3dfd6dd
